{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "AMO",
  "chapter": 2,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the LORD; For three transgressions of Moab, and for four, I will not turn away ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his punishment",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": because he burned the bones of the king of Edom into lime:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I will send a fire upon Moab, and it shall devour the palaces of Kirioth: and Moab shall die with tumult, with shouting, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with the sound of the trumpet:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I will cut off the judge from the midst of it, and will slay all its princes with him, saith the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the LORD; For three transgressions of Judah, and for four, I will not turn away ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their punishment",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": because they have despised the law of the LORD, and have not kept his commandments, and their lies caused them to err, after which their fathers have walked:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I will send a fire upon Judah, and it shall devour the palaces of Jerusalem.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the LORD; For three transgressions of Israel, and for four, I will not turn away ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their punishment",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": because they sold the righteous for silver, and the poor for a pair of shoes;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That pant after the dust of the earth on the head of the poor, and turn aside the way of the meek: and a man and his father will go in to the ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "same",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " maid, to profane my holy name:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they lay ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "themselves",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " down upon clothes laid to pledge by every altar, and they drink the wine of the condemned ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the house of their god.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yet I destroyed the Amorite before them, whose hight ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " like the hight of the cedars, and he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " strong as the oaks; yet I destroyed his fruit from above, and his roots from beneath.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Also I brought you from the land of Egypt, and led you forty years through the wilderness, to possess the land of the Amorite.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I raised up of your sons for prophets, and of your young men for Nazarites. ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Is it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not even thus, O ye children of Israel? saith the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ye gave the Nazarites wine to drink; and commanded the prophets, saying, Prophesy not.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, I am pressed under you, as a cart is pressed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " full of sheaves.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore the flight shall perish from the swift, and the strong shall not strengthen his force, neither shall the mighty deliver himself:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither shall he stand that handleth the bow; and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " swift of foot shall not deliver ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "himself",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": neither shall he that rideth the horse deliver himself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AMO.2.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:AMO.2.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " courageous among the mighty shall flee away naked in that day, saith the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
